    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HQ3ZCS8Y0Q5ARZ8HSB60CFTP\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to port an SMS sending number into Klaviyo. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQ3ZCS8YESD103VGYW4Q9T5J\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>Please note that porting: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Can take around 4 weeks. When migrating to Klaviyo, please build in time for this process.</li>\n<li>Will result in the loss of any voice capabilities.</li>\n<li>Requires up to ~2–5 business days of downtime when the number cannot be used (due to verification and carriers needing to re-route traffic to the number). </li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"accordion accordion--default\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item-title\"><strong>Types of numbers that can be ported</strong></div>\n<div class=\"accordion__item-content\">\n<table style=\"height: 132px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px; height: 22px\"><strong>Type of number</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px; height: 22px\"><strong>Can it be ported? </strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px; height: 22px\">Toll-free</td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px; height: 22px\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px; height: 22px\">Short code</td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px; height: 22px\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px; height: 22px\">Shared short code</td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px; height: 22px\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px; height: 44px\">Branded sender ID</td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px; height: 44px\">No, but you can set the ID to be the same as your previous one</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 157.992px\">Long code</td>\n<td style=\"width: 519.008px\">Yes in the UK, Ireland, and Australia</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQ3ZCS8YBSEQD8HGC6KJY6N8\">Port a toll-free number</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>SMS</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720772629019\" alt=\"SMS_sender_information.jpeg\">\n</li>\n<li>Click into the <strong>Request Additional Numbers</strong> dropdown.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Port an Existing Number</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Submit Port Request</strong>.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720760831131\" alt=\"Modal to submit a port request\" width=\"520\" height=\"211\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQ3ZCS8YS8EC21JB72PZ4ERE\">Port a short code</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>SMS</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Activate </strong>for the country your short code is for (e.g., if you have a US short code, click <strong>Activate</strong> where \"United States\" is the supported region).</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Short Code</strong> from the list of numbers.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Complete Order</strong> to access the application.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HQ3ZCS8ZAFVAVBPA5YDE7PWS\">Outcome</h2>\n<p>After you submit your port request, you can expect to be contacted by a Klaviyo representative. After someone reaches out and you submit all required information, the porting process begins: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>For long codes, porting can take 2 to 4 weeks to complete.</li>\n<li>For toll-free numbers, porting can take 2 to 4 weeks to complete.</li>\n<li>For short codes, porting can take 4 weeks to complete. </li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
